    structure: includes 2+ outward cells (dr<0 or dc<0, forming the outer "tail") AND 1+ inward-diagonal cells (k,k) with k>=1
    symmetry: diagonally symmetric about dr==dc axis (every (dr,dc) has mirror (dc,dr))
  corners:
    every detectable frame-corner is either a source or a target (no inert corners)
